from the rulebook on the vekn site linked above:

> 6. Minion Phase
> Most of the activity in the game occurs in the minion phases. During your minion phase, you may have your minions take actions. Only ready untapped minions can take actions, and taking an action taps the acting minion. Other Methuselah's ready untapped minions may attempt to block your action, and blocking taps the blocking minion (see Resolve Any Block Attempts, sec. 6.2.2).
